A grammar where production rules can depend on surrounding symbols (context) - type systems handle this level; e.g., \"variable must be declared before use\" requires checking context of the usage site.

A grammar where production rules can depend on **surrounding symbols** (context) - type systems handle this level; e.g., "variable must be declared before use" requires checking context of the usage site.
